    "Name": "Tai-sho",
    "Details": "The Tai-sho concentrates on keeping an enemy at long range and using targeting data from friendly units to enhance its long range capabilities. The primary weapons it carries are a pair of ER PPCs capable of keeping an adversary at arms reach. These are backed up by an Ultra Autocannon/10 which can fire at twice the rate of a standard autocannon.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
